Generated by `python -m discopy.lean` from the classes of
`discopy.abc`: do not edit. Each structure has the operations of its
rules and axioms, untyped as in the Python, each rule its typing law and
each axiom a `def`, all of them in its `Laws`. The classes it does not
compile yet:

- `FeedbackCategory`: it calls feedback with keywords ['mem']
